-- Prepared serialized-card registry expansion.
-- Source snapshot: Scryfall is:serialized, 2026-09-07.
-- Includes every released English-language MTG serialized release plus all four
-- Assassin's Creed serialized cards, retaining their historical printed names.
-- Reality Fracture is intentionally excluded until its 2026-10-02 release.

